@accessToken = {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Chat (先执行 Login 获取 Token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "prompt": "现在几点"
}

### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/register
content-type: application/json

{
    "username": "demo_user",
    "password": "DemoPass123!"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/login
content-type: application/json

{
    "username": "demo_user",
    "password": "DemoPass123!"
}

### Create Session (先执行 Login 获取 Token)
# @name createSession
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sessions
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List Sessions (分页：page 从 1 开始，page_size 每页条数)
# 响应 data 含 list / total / page / page_size，前端据此算总页数
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sessions?page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
